  "body": "Good News!  Title Issued!\r\nIf you are looking for a home with proper space, privacy and room for the whole family, this is something truly different from the typical new build.\r\n\r\nSet on a 179m² corner site with approximately 157m² of floor area, this spacious four-bedroom, three-bathroom home offers a layout designed for real family living — including two master suites and two generous living areas.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n• Two Master Suites\r\nA master suite is conveniently located on the ground floor, ideal for extended family, guests or those wanting single-level living. Upstairs, the main master suite offers a walk-in wardrobe and a proper ensuite bathroom.\r\n\r\n• Spacious Kitchen & Storage\r\nThe kitchen features a large island bench, generous storage and plenty of workspace, making it practical for everyday family life as well as entertaining. Storage has also been thoughtfully provided throughout both levels.\r\n\r\n• Two Generous Living Areas\r\nThe ground-floor living area opens through large sliding doors to a private decking area, creating an easy indoor-outdoor flow. Upstairs, the second living area is spacious and versatile, giving the family plenty of room to spread out.\r\n\r\n• Comfort All Year Round\r\nTwo heat pumps provide comfortable living throughout the seasons, while the generous floor plan gives you the space you simply don’t find in many new builds.\r\n\r\n• Quiet Cul-de-Sac Location\r\nTucked away in a peaceful cul-de-sac, this home enjoys a quiet neighbourhood setting, with Himalaya Reserve directly across the road. Half Moon Bay Marina, ferry terminal, supermarkets and everyday amenities are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nPositioned on a corner site with four homes available to choose from, there is excellent off-street parking and more breathing space than many comparable new developments.\r\n\r\nIf you have been looking at new builds but don’t want to compromise on space, this is the one worth seeing. Call us today for more information!",
